__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Run output roots — run directories, dossiers, live receipts over real
# subjects, and screenshot-class captures are local-only; only schemas,
# verifiers, READMEs, and synthetic examples commit (see
# plugins/epistemic-skills/contracts/README.md).
outputs/
artifacts/uat/**/screenshots/
.epistemic-events/
outputs/epistemic-events/
pilot/runs/

# Skill run telemetry — real ledger/adjudication lines are runtime state
# (operator-private), not public content; only the synthetic example ships
# (see plugins/epistemic-skills/skills/gauntlet/runs/README.md).
**/runs/*.jsonl
!**/runs/*.example.jsonl
!**/runs/README.md
